	&lt;li&gt;2nd part of requirement: GEHC does not provide databases specific accounts to connect to DoseWatch database. OPs need to check if DWH can bring expected data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;2. &lt;ins&gt;DOD cases:&lt;/ins&gt;  explained in   &lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira-dose.apps.ge-healthcare.net/secure/attachment/142731/142731_SR-6822_DW_Engineering_Investigations_final.xlsx&quot; title=&quot;SR-6822_DW_Engineering_Investigations_final.xlsx attached to SR-6822&quot;&gt;SR-6822_DW_Engineering_Investigations_final.xlsx&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://jira-dose.apps.ge-healthcare.net/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Reference KB article : &lt;a href=&quot;https://confluence-dose.apps.ge-healthcare.net/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=70193287&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://confluence-dose.apps.ge-healthcare.net/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=70193287&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;3. No data available in GST tab  for CT Logs exams&lt;/ins&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
GST is not compatible with CT Logs devices in 3.4.0&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;4. Various cases :&lt;/ins&gt; investigated by L4 and Engineering&lt;/p&gt;</customfieldvalue>

